// Clue Name :
"P3191199960" "The Nexus of Thorns"
// DetailString :
"P1146232905" "The demon Sparcetriel was willing to share its secret knowledge as part of its revenge against the Circle of Thorns. The first thing it wanted you to do was prove your ability by defeating members of the Circle. You handled this, and returned to the fiend."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Mission2Clue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DetailString :
"P2551412015" "The demon Sparcetriel was willing to share its secret knowledge as part of its revenge against the Circle of Thorns. The first thing it wanted you to do was prove your ability by defeating members of the Circle. You handled this, and returned to the fiend. <br><br>Next, you had to stop the united forces of Longbow, Wyvern, and the Legacy Chain from interrupting your attack with a strike of their own. You defeated the operation's leaders, clearing the way for yourself."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SouvenirClueDef - V_ReSpec1_SouvenirClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// tDetailString :
"P2585459987" "The demon Sparcetriel was willing to share its secret knowledge as part of its revenge against the Circle of Thorns. The first thing it wanted you to do was prove your ability by defeating members of the Circle. You handled this, and returned to the fiend. <br><br>Next, you had to stop the united forces of Longbow, Wyvern, and the Legacy Chain from interrupting your attack with a strike of their own. You defeated the operation's leaders, clearing the way for yourself. <br><br>You entered the chamber of the thorn tree, defeated its numerous vines, and ripped the Nexus of Thorns from the Tree's heartwood. You can still feel the stolen energy coursing through you, a force that can re-make you, improve you, and re-shape your very powers."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P441546917" "I will tell you of a place where the Circle of Thorns routes their mystic powers to create great and fell effects. Through brute force and evil will, you can steal this power from them, and use to re-forge yourself. But before I tell you where to find this place, you must first show me you have the might to succeed. Defeat 25 members of the Circle of Thorns, and return to me when you are done."
// AcceptString :
"P3771270129" "Defeat 25 Circle of Thorns"
// SendOffString :
"P2046312625" "I care not where you defeat them, so long as it is done. Return when the task is complete."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2374042264" "You'll learn more once you've completed this small task."

